/*
  SLOTrackingCard.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0253 · SLOTrackingCard (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SLOTrackingCard` resolves (table "SLOTrackingCard") lives here with its web
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master
  catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact strings rendered by the web source
  (features/system/components/status/SLOTrackingCard.tsx), where the English label
  IS the key. The web component hardcodes its English; native routes every literal
  through this facade so no English lives in the Swift code. The remainder back the
  native state envelope (accessibility, freshness chip / banner, loading / empty /
  error chrome).
*/

